===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|Darwin}}, {{m|enm|Derwin}}, from {{inh|en|ang|Dēorwine|gloss={{non-gloss definition|a given name}}}}, composed of {{m|ang|dēore|gloss=dear}} + {{m|ang|wine|gloss=friend}}.

The city in Australia is named after {{w|Charles Darwin}}.

